{"3785300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bombardiro Crocodilo MISSION", "steam_appid": 3785300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast through waves of enemies in the explosive and fast-paced shoot 'em up inspired by the world of Brainrot! Fight your way through to rescue Ballerina Capuchina from the slippered fins of Tralalero Tralala.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ AI DISCLAIMER ⚠️ We haven’t used any artificial intelligence tools in our video game. The long afternoons of testing and the endless days of hand drawn art and programming, all of which we can fully prove through our extensive collection of editable files, stand as evidence of that. Thank you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785300/extras/d7eb8367f2fbcd9ca4a848111059b6d3.avif?t=1759777495\" width=700 height=460 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a side-scrolling shoot 'em up packed with action and bullet hell chaos—though carefully tuned to keep things fun rather than frustrating. Dive into the  intense stages of <strong>Bombardiro Crocodilo MISSION</strong> and take on the challenge. Defeat the major bosses from the story zones to finally set Ballerina Capuchina free from the clutches of Tralalero Tralala and his henchmen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785300/extras/1f0d9ca0868bd1ac9e396c30f2dce182.avif?t=1759777495\" width=600 height=108 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Bombardiro Crocodilo in this explosive shoot 'em up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, fluid, and frantic gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock  playable characters with different characteristics, including Bombardini Cusini Ballerina Capuchin and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your skills after completing certain levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >21 incredible handmade stages (3 biomes-zones)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 zones with different enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your special power to destroy enemies (super power)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill waves of enemies in over handcrafted stages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast through waves of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins to unlock playable characters inspired by the world of Brainrot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock characters like Bombardiro Crocodilo, Bombardini Gusini, Ballerina Capuchina, and many more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various types of bullets with unique characteristics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the  main bosses from the Brainrot universe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore thrilling stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the exotic original soundtrack crafted for your journey as the savior of Ballerina Capuchina</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785300/extras/9572c675617f153f9c197820386a9576.avif?t=1759777495\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast through waves of enemies in the explosive and fast-paced shoot 'em up inspired by the world of Brainrot! Fight your way through to rescue Ballerina Capuchina from the slippered fins of Tralalero Tralala.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ AI DISCLAIMER ⚠️ We haven’t used any artificial intelligence tools in our video game. The long afternoons of testing and the endless days of hand drawn art and programming, all of which we can fully prove through our ext